The shortest distance Jenny needs to travel to meet John is AC.

Now, using the Pythagorean theorem,

AC = sqrt{4² + 3²} 

AC = sqrt{16 + 9} 

AC = sqrt{25} 

AC = 5 km

Hence, **5 km **is the correct answer.
